870
00:33:25,204 --> 00:33:28,604
I've learned about life from these two.

871
00:33:29,004 --> 00:33:30,914
Hye Won said this to me.

872
00:33:31,214 --> 00:33:33,713
You wouldn't know, but Jang Woo said this to me.

873
00:33:33,714 --> 00:33:34,783
I...

874
00:33:34,784 --> 00:33:36,514
So I thought to myself...

875
00:33:36,814 --> 00:33:37,913
Jang Woo said this to me.

876
00:33:37,914 --> 00:33:38,984
"I..."

877
00:33:40,884 --> 00:33:42,224
