881
00:33:51,234 --> 00:33:52,893
Ju Seung, it's his talk show.

882
00:33:52,894 --> 00:33:54,833
It's too much.

883
00:33:54,834 --> 00:33:57,374
- Ju Seung got his revenge then. - While I was gone...

884
00:33:57,674 --> 00:33:59,504
It's a bit like "Sebasi Talk."

885
00:33:59,774 --> 00:34:01,104
Kian84 is touching his tie.

886
00:34:01,474 --> 00:34:03,313
- Kian84 is touching his tie. - "Sebasi Talk."

887
00:34:03,314 --> 00:34:04,314
(Dazed)

888
00:34:04,315 --> 00:34:07,314
Please give a round of applause to Jo Hye Won.

889
00:34:07,484 --> 00:34:08,644
