896
00:34:21,864 --> 00:34:25,394
They've found each other's only one in life.

897
00:34:25,694 --> 00:34:27,034
I sincerely congratulate them.

898
00:34:27,364 --> 00:34:29,504
They say that your life follows the title of the show.

899
00:34:29,804 --> 00:34:31,774
My representative work is I Live Alone.

900
00:34:32,504 --> 00:34:34,573
I'll continue to live alone diligently,

901
00:34:34,574 --> 00:34:36,373
