904
00:34:40,714 --> 00:34:42,584
I let people know that I was single.

905
00:34:43,684 --> 00:34:46,214
Lead a cool life respectively.

906
00:34:46,284 --> 00:34:47,484
I'll root for you guys. Thank you.

907
00:34:48,854 --> 00:34:52,224
