909
00:34:56,294 --> 00:34:57,934
- from the officiant. - That's a mockery.

910
00:34:59,594 --> 00:35:02,864
Officiant, please take your leave.

911
00:35:03,274 --> 00:35:05,004
That was funny.

912
00:35:05,704 --> 00:35:07,404
