919
00:35:22,084 --> 00:35:23,184
Well done.

920
00:35:23,924 --> 00:35:25,794
- It was touching. - Really?

921
00:35:25,854 --> 00:35:27,563
- Some people cried. - It was no joke.

922
00:35:27,564 --> 00:35:28,624
Who cried?

923
00:35:29,094 --> 00:35:30,364
