926
00:35:35,134 --> 00:35:37,974
If some people cried, my message must've been touching.

927
00:35:39,104 --> 00:35:41,544
And the most crucial review came from Hwang Shin Hye.

928
00:35:42,274 --> 00:35:44,414
She said my wedding message was the most entertaining.

929
00:35:44,774 --> 00:35:46,713
