931
00:35:49,814 --> 00:35:50,883
Oh, my.

932
00:35:50,884 --> 00:35:52,484
It's my first time seeing you...

933
00:35:52,584 --> 00:35:54,124
- in real life. - It's our first time meeting.

934
00:35:54,254 --> 00:35:55,654
I was so surprised.

935
00:35:56,254 --> 00:35:57,993
