936
00:35:57,994 --> 00:35:59,823
- Thank you. - Today's wedding message...

937
00:35:59,824 --> 00:36:02,624
- Okay. - was the most entertaining one...

938
00:36:02,794 --> 00:36:04,564
- out of the ones I've heard. - Really?

939
00:36:04,934 --> 00:36:06,094
It was Hwang Shin Hye's pick.

940
00:36:07,134 --> 00:36:09,564
That boosted my confidence.

941
00:36:10,404 --> 00:36:13,104
Moomoo's wedding message. The Gen Z wedding message.

942
00:36:13,644 --> 00:36:15,244
It was a success. It was a hot debut.

943
00:36:15,474 --> 00:36:17,614
- A hot debut. - It was so successful...

944
