971
00:37:22,544 --> 00:37:23,814
Groom and bride.

972
00:37:24,974 --> 00:37:26,174
Toward the bright future!

973
00:37:26,844 --> 00:37:28,084
Toward the bright future!

974
00:37:29,114 --> 00:37:30,184
March!

975
00:37:31,054 --> 00:37:32,114
March!

