2130
01:26:29,668 --> 01:26:31,037
(There's Latin music playing.)

2131
01:26:31,038 --> 01:26:32,568
(Where is this place?)

2132
01:26:33,468 --> 01:26:35,568
(The view that is seen during off-season)

2133
01:26:36,708 --> 01:26:39,238
(The golden awards that represent his hard work)

2134
01:26:40,208 --> 01:26:41,947
(Fancy items that suit that Golden Glover)

2135
01:26:41,948 --> 01:26:43,178
(They're like gifts that I give to myself.)

2136
01:26:44,048 --> 01:26:46,487
(I can't rest even during off-season!)

2137
01:26:46,488 --> 01:26:47,648
(Breathing out)

2138
01:26:48,388 --> 01:26:49,518
(It's easy.)

2139
01:26:50,088 --> 01:26:53,187
(With his golden muscles that aren't easy to make,)

2140
01:26:53,188 --> 01:26:54,888
(he's working out easily.)

2141
01:26:55,888 --> 01:26:57,158
(He puts on his glove tightly.)

2142
01:26:57,258 --> 01:26:58,858
(Shall we begin in earnest?)

2143
01:26:59,558 --> 01:27:02,027
I cook when I want something.

2144
01:27:02,028 --> 01:27:03,028
(Golden muscles)

2145
01:27:03,098 --> 01:27:04,998
(Shaking)

2146
01:27:06,098 --> 01:27:07,768
(I'll show you my golden cooking skills as well.)

2147
01:27:08,608 --> 01:27:10,008
(The Major Leaguer is a lover of Korean food.)

2148
01:27:10,608 --> 01:27:11,738
(Slurping)

2149
01:27:12,638 --> 01:27:14,208
(It's so good.)

2150
01:27:15,048 --> 01:27:16,048
(What's up?)

2151
01:27:17,518 --> 01:27:18,748
(Why are you here again?)

2152
01:27:19,788 --> 01:27:22,248
(Kim Ha Seong's Golden Off-Season)

2153
01:27:23,218 --> 01:27:24,658
