2154
01:27:25,418 --> 01:27:26,418
(Mesmerized)

2155
01:27:26,958 --> 01:27:28,288
(It's the kimchi of my African American dancer's mother-in-law.)

2156
01:27:28,858 --> 01:27:30,828
